{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Yuyuko  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hakugyokurou."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The mansion where the princess of the Netherworld resided."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >Hmmm, Gensokyo stopped you say?"
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >It's not that it stopped, more like it wasn't moving."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >I get it, I understand that feeling."
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's pretty much like the Netherworld."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >You see, to die is to stop changing."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To be unchanging, you could say is to last in a perpetual time."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Perpetual...oh"
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >In other words, time is stopped."
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's why time stands still in the the Netherworld."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >That reminds me, she also said something about the power of perpetuity."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >She? You mean that Ariya girl you were talking about?"
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Yeah, she caused the incident, but her motive was all over the place. I didn't really get it."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >Her motive for bringing Gensokyo to a standstill?"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well that's obvious, wouldn't it be more comfortable that way?",
                "I bet that girl is a cynical one."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Cynical?"
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >It means that she wants to die."
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >I think that's probably wrong, but maybe, her goal with this incident was to turn all of Gensokyo into a world after death."
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >You're already dead!"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Yuyuko  >Ah, if that were to happen my work as an administrator would pile up so much I'd die. That's way too black."
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Judging from Ariya's demeanor, it doesn't feel like Gensokyo's death was her goal with the incident."
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But, if Yuyuko is correct, then to refuse change is to die."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Would the goddess of unchanging remain a god of death, no matter what she does?"
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If so, then there is some sense in sealing her in the depths of the pyramid."
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For some reason, a little sadness came over Reimu, and she decided to visit Ariya again sometime."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending　No.03 Already Dead$>"
            ]
        }
    }
}